  "description": "A talented makeup artist, she runs her own beauty shop. His daily life? Pamper your customers and make their life more beautiful! Except that she is hiding a big secret: she is the girlfriend of a celebrity, and has lived her romantic relationship in the shadows for years! But all that will change the day he is offered to participate in an extraordinary project: to become the face of a major cosmetics brand on the Internet. \n\n**Note:** *The chapter count consist of the Prologue Season 1 + Prologue Season 2 + 72 chapters + Epilogue.*",
